            "title": "港股｜NBA中國賽澳門開打 馬雲蔡崇信碧咸成龍齊觀戰",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"港股｜NBA中國賽澳門開打 馬雲蔡崇信碧咸成龍齊觀戰\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">港股｜NBA中國賽澳門開打 馬雲蔡崇信碧咸成龍齊觀戰</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">NBA中國賽2026周五（9日）在澳門開打，達拉斯獨行俠與休斯敦火箭對壘。阿里巴巴創辦人馬雲、董事會主席蔡崇信、泡泡瑪特創辦人王寧、影星成龍及前球星碧咸到場觀戰。淘寶作為首席合作夥伴，為88VIP用戶安排福利，超過2000人獲抽中，佔全場觀眾約五分之一。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1-nba%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E8%B3%BD%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80%E9%96%8B%E6%89%93-%E9%A6%AC%E9%9B%B2%E8%94%A1%E5%B4%87%E4%BF%A1%E7%A2%A7%E5%92%B8%E6%88%90%E9%BE%8D%E9%BD%8A%E8%A7%80%E6%88%B0-070027173.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-10-10 15:14:25",
